{
    "title": "Bed Bath & Beyond",
    "description": "In the new Bed Bath and Beyond app you\u2019ll be able to streamline your shopping experience so you can achieve your dream home faster and easier than ever.\r\n\r\nSearch, browse and shop thousands of home good items right from the palm of your hand. Whether you are furnishing your entire home or just searching for a great deal or a gift Bed Bath & Beyond is the place to make shopping simple and affordable.\r\n\r\nWith the Bed Bath & Beyond app, you can:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Shop for furniture and decor with app-exclusive deals and discounts.\r\n\u2022 Bookmark your stylish finds in a wish list and share them with friends.\r\n\u2022 Get instant alerts on price drops for items you're interested in.\r\n\u2022 Store all your coupons in one convenient place.\r\n\u2022 Check out quickly and easily with saved logins and payments.\r\n\u2022 Track your orders from start to finish.\r\n\r\nDownload the Bed Bath & Beyond app today to experience more for every room, every home, & every budget.",
    "descriptionHTML": "In the new Bed Bath and Beyond app you\u2019ll be able to streamline your shopping experience so you can achieve your dream home faster and easier than ever.<br><br>Search, browse and shop thousands of home good items right from the palm of your hand. Whether you are furnishing your entire home or just searching for a great deal or a gift Bed Bath &amp; Beyond is the place to make shopping simple and affordable.<br><br>With the Bed Bath &amp; Beyond app, you can:<br><br>\u2022 Shop for furniture and decor with app-exclusive deals and discounts.<br>\u2022 Bookmark your stylish finds in a wish list and share them with friends.<br>\u2022 Get instant alerts on price drops for items you&#39;re interested in.<br>\u2022 Store all your coupons in one convenient place.<br>\u2022 Check out quickly and easily with saved logins and payments.<br>\u2022 Track your orders from start to finish.<br><br>Download the Bed Bath &amp; Beyond app today to experience more for every room, every home, &amp; every budget.",
